      "question_text": "Tzanck smear is positive in?",
      "options": {
        "A": "Tinea infections",
        "B": "HSV and VZV (acantholytic cells/multinucleate giant cells)",
        "C": "Bacterial infections",
        "D": "Syphilis"
      },
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Tzanck smear: scraping from base of vesicle → multinucleated giant cells/acantholytic cells in HSV and VZV (chickenpox). Also positive in pemphigus vulgaris (acantholytic cells, no giant cells)."
